            "id": 127035,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>toDo.removeLast()</code> değerini bir değişkene atadığımızda, değişken kaldırdığımız değeri depolar.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" chore = toDo.removeLast()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(chore)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"dishes\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>chore</code>, ardından <code>=</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
