            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Etkin kullanıcılar dizisine <code>\"joe\"</code> ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" activeUsers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;mike&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"activeUsers.append(\" /><text value=\"&quot;joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(activeUsers)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".removeLast()\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[&quot;sue&quot;, &quot;mike&quot;, &quot;joe&quot;]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>activeUsers</code>, ardından <code>.append(\"joe\")</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: End of the array",
            "id": 127042,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>.append(\"sugar\")</code> kodunu yazarak dizinin sonuna <code>\"sugar\"</code> ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cookies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;flour&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;butter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"cookies.append(\" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(cookies)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"57\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[&quot;flour&quot;, &quot;butter&quot;, &quot;sugar&quot;]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>.append(\"sugar\")</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
