            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dizinin sonuna önce <code>2</code>, ardından <code>500</code> ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" transactions = [-\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"transactions += [\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(transactions)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[-100, 5, 2, 500]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>2</code>, ardından <code>500</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
